  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 1.33,
      "e": 3.17,
      "text": "(film reel spooling)"
    },
    {
      "s": 3.17,
      "e": 5.58,
      "text": "(beeping)"
    },
    {
      "s": 5.58,
      "e": 8.4,
      "text": "- Well, when an emergency happens,"
    },
    {
      "s": 8.4,
      "e": 10.14,
      "text": "our job is to fill in wherever is needed"
    },
    {
      "s": 10.14,
      "e": 12.12,
      "text": "to help the community at the time."
    },
    {
      "s": 12.12,
      "e": 15.42,
      "text": "- We usually go out before the disaster hits,"
    },
    {
      "s": 15.42,
      "e": 19.16,
      "text": "and set up, making sure that emergency services"
    },
    {
      "s": 19.16,
      "e": 22.54,
      "text": "can get through to citizens after a destruction"
    },
    {
      "s": 22.54,
      "e": 23.69,
      "text": "like a hurricane."
    },
    {
      "s": 23.69,
      "e": 25.92,
      "text": "People can get through, and get back to their homes,"
    },
    {
      "s": 25.92,
      "e": 27.56,
      "text": "and start rebuilding."
    },
    {
      "s": 29.22,
      "e": 30.32,
      "text": "- I'm Captain Hornick,"
    },
    {
      "s": 30.32,
      "e": 32.23,
      "text": "and I'm the Logistics Readiness Officer"
    },
    {
      "s": 32.23,
      "e": 34.18,
      "text": "here at the 202nd Red Horse."
    },
    {
      "s": 34.18,
      "e": 37.13,
      "text": "My job is to make sure we have all the assets needed,"
    },
    {
      "s": 37.13,
      "e": 39.81,
      "text": "and everybody's ready to go at that particular job."
    },
    {
      "s": 39.81,
      "e": 43.24,
      "text": "So I am the officer in charge of keeping the readiness"
    },
    {
      "s": 43.24,
      "e": 45.85,
      "text": "for our personnel and our equipment,"
    },
    {
      "s": 45.85,
      "e": 47.58,
      "text": "as well as the accountability for everybody"
    },
    {
      "s": 47.58,
      "e": 51.21,
      "text": "when we stand up for any type of operations"
    },
    {
      "s": 51.21,
      "e": 53.65,
      "text": "that actually leave the home station."
    },
    {
      "s": 53.65,
      "e": 55.42,
      "text": "We do a lot of training with communities,"
    },
    {
      "s": 55.42,
      "e": 56.91,
      "text": "so our job is to clear the way"
    },
    {
      "s": 56.91,
      "e": 59.3,
      "text": "so that those folks can actually get in and do their jobs,"
    },
    {
      "s": 59.3,
      "e": 61.12,
      "text": "say, FPL and stuff like that."
    },
    {
      "s": 61.12,
      "e": 62.25,
      "text": "So we're at the forefront."
    },
    {
      "s": 62.25,
      "e": 64.64,
      "text": "In fact, we're currently out there staging folks"
    },
    {
      "s": 64.64,
      "e": 68.68,
      "text": "and getting ready for any operations that come our way."
    },
    {
      "s": 71.64,
      "e": 74.56,
      "text": "(orchestral music)"
    }
  ],
